                                            <span class="eyebrow">Platform features</span>
                                            <h2 class="display-sm" style="max-width:520px;margin:0 auto 16px">Everything you need.<br><em>Nothing you don't.</em></h2>
                                            <p class="lead" style="text-align:center;margin:0 auto;max-width:480px">Simple tools that solve real problems for Ugandan communities collecting money together.</p>
                                          </div>
                                          <div class="feat-grid">
                                            <div class="feat-card" data-r="l">
                                              <div class="feat-icon">
                                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round">
                                                  <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5Z" />
                                                  <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5" />
                                                  <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5" />
                                                </svg>
                                              </div>
                                              <h3>Pledge tracking</h3>
                                              <p>People promise money and Obumu tracks it. Automatic reminders mean they pay without you having to ask.</p>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="feat-card" data-r>
                                              <div class="feat-icon">
                                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round">
                                                  <rect x="1" y="5" width="22" height="16" rx="2" />
                                                  <path d="M1 10h22M5 15h2M9 15h6" />
                                                </svg>
                                              </div>
                                              <h3>All payment methods</h3>
                                              <p>MTN Mobile Money, Airtel Money, and Visa all in one checkout. No switching between apps or menus.</p>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="feat-card" data-r="r">
                                              <div class="feat-icon">
                                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round">
                                                  <path d="M12 2a10 10 0 100 20A10 10 0 0012 2Z" />
                                                  <path d="M12 6v6l4 2" />
                                                </svg>
                                              </div>
                                              <h3>Fast payouts</h3>
                                              <p>Payments clear instantly and land directly on your MTN or Airtel mobile money account. Zero delays, zero forms.</p>
                                            </div>
                                          </div>
                                        </div>
                                      </section>

